    </div>
    <div class="faq-grid">
      <div class="faq-item" onclick="toggleFaq(this)"><div class="faq-q"><span>What is one4k and how does the service work?</span><i class="fas fa-chevron-down faq-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></i></div><div class="faq-a"><span>one4k is an official IPTV service that streams 79,000+ live international channels and 249,000+ on-demand titles over the internet to any compatible device. After subscribing, you receive credentials to activate your preferred streaming app — setup takes under 60 seconds.</span></div></div>
      <div class="faq-item" onclick="toggleFaq(this)"><div class="faq-q"><span>Which devices are compatible with one4k?</span><i class="fas fa-chevron-down faq-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></i></div><div class="faq-a"><span>one4k works on Smart TVs (Samsung, LG), Amazon Firestick, Android TV, Nvidia Shield, iOS (iPhone &amp; iPad), Android smartphones &amp; tablets, MAG boxes, Windows PC, Mac, web browsers, TiviMate, IPTV Smarters Pro, and Xbox.</span></div></div>
      <div class="faq-item" onclick="toggleFaq(this)"><div class="faq-q"><span>How fast is activation after payment?</span><i class="fas fa-chevron-down faq-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></i></div><div class="faq-a"><span>Standard subscriptions are activated in under 60 seconds. Reseller panel accounts are created within 5–10 minutes of payment confirmation. Our team is available 24/7 via WhatsApp for the fastest possible setup.</span></div></div>
      <div class="faq-item" onclick="toggleFaq(this)"><div class="faq-q"><span>What video quality does one4k support?</span><i class="fas fa-chevron-down faq-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></i></div><div class="faq-a"><span>one4k supports SD (480p), HD (720p), Full HD (1080p), 4K Ultra HD (2160p) and 8K (4320p) on the 12-month Premium+ plan. A minimum of 25 Mbps is recommended for 4K content. A stable wired connection gives the best experience.</span></div></div>
      <div class="faq-item" onclick="toggleFaq(this)"><div class="faq-q"><span>What payment methods do you accept?</span><i class="fas fa-chevron-down faq-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></i></div><div class="faq-a"><span>We accept PayPal, Binance (crypto), Cash Plus, Debit or Credit Card, and Bank Transfer. All payments are handled securely and your financial information is never stored on our servers.</span></div></div>
      <div class="faq-item" onclick="toggleFaq(this)"><div class="faq-q"><span>Is there a money-back guarantee?</span><i class="fas fa-chevron-down faq-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></i></div><div class="faq-a"><span>Yes. All one4k subscriptions include a 15-day satisfaction guarantee. If our support team cannot resolve persistent technical issues within 48 hours, we will provide a full refund or credit.</span></div></div>
      <div class="faq-item" onclick="toggleFaq(this)"><div class="faq-q"><span>How does the reseller program work?</span><i class="fas fa-chevron-down faq-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></i></div><div class="faq-a"><span>Our reseller program gives you a dedicated management panel to create and activate IPTV subscriptions for your own clients. Packages start from 10 credits at €210. Your panel is created within 5–10 minutes. Full 24/7 support is included. Visit our Reseller page for full details.</span></div></div>
      <div class="faq-item" onclick="toggleFaq(this)"><div class="faq-q"><span>What internet speed do I need?</span><i class="fas fa-chevron-down faq-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></i></div><div class="faq-a"><span>Minimum recommendations: SD — 5 Mbps, HD — 10 Mbps, Full HD — 15 Mbps, 4K — 25 Mbps, 8K — 50+ Mbps. A wired ethernet connection is preferred over Wi-Fi for the most stable streaming experience.</span></div></div>
      <div class="faq-item" onclick="toggleFaq(this)"><div class="faq-q"><span>Does one4k include adult content?</span><i class="fas fa-chevron-down faq-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></i></div><div class="faq-a"><span>one4k is a general-purpose streaming service for entertainment, sports, news, movies and international programming. Adult channels are not included in our standard retail subscriptions. Reseller panel operators have access to an extended content library through our wholesale infrastructure; it is the responsibility of each operator to comply with applicable local regulations regarding content distribution.</span></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

